    "Kalimatnya diproses di perangkatmu. Hanya jika kalimat sulit dipahami, teksnya (tanpa saldo atau nomor rekening) dikirim ke server Saku untuk dibantu model bahasa. Penyedia model tidak menyimpan dan tidak melatih model dari teks itu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sentences are processed on your device. Only if one is hard to understand, its text (without balances or account numbers) is sent to Saku's server for a language model to help. The model provider does not store it or train on it."
